{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16150","headline":"和胡将军寓直 · 王建","name":"和胡将军寓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫鸦栖定禁枪攒，楼殿深严月色寒。\n进状直穿金戟槊，探更先傍玉钩栏。\n漏传五点班初合，鼓动三声仗已端。\n遥见正南宣不坐，新栽松树唤人看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}